-- ss 26, 27: the decision and reasons.
#ASSERT `Will I be given reasons question` `the award was refused` FALSE EQUALS `yes: I must be given the refusal in writing, with written reasons, whether or not I ask (ss 26, 27(2)(a))`
#ASSERT `Will I be given reasons question` `the award was refused` TRUE EQUALS `yes: I must be given the refusal in writing, with written reasons, whether or not I ask (ss 26, 27(2)(a))`
#ASSERT `Will I be given reasons question` `an award was made` TRUE EQUALS `yes: I must be given the award in writing, and, because I asked in writing, written reasons for it (ss 26, 27(1))`
#ASSERT `Will I be given reasons question` `an award was made` FALSE EQUALS `I must be given the award in writing (s 26); written reasons must be given if I ask for them in writing (s 27(1))`

